    "message": "Scope musl to the target toolchain (enables arm64 musl cross builds) (#206)\n\nTighten the use_musl guards from !toolchain_for_rust_host_build_tools to\ncurrent_toolchain == default_toolchain, so musl applies only to the target\ntoolchain. For cross builds (e.g. x64 host -> arm64 target) this keeps the x64\nhost and snapshot toolchains (clang_x64_v8_arm64) on glibc automatically,\nwithout needing per-arch glibc toolchain variants. x86_64 musl is unchanged\n(its host is already the non-default clang_x64_glibc).",
